"spoiler":false,"text":"普段はお公家様のようにおっとりしているが、実は楽しいことが大好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なにか企んでいるときは、必ずと言っていいほど主人公に協力させようとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は、好きな相手ほど困らせたくなる小悪魔的な一面も？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「修平くん、これはひのまる命令よ？」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14347","sourceWorkId":"13105","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒会長、3年生。学園理事長の孫にして、資産家の娘でもある。そのため、信じられない邸宅に住んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段はお公家様のようにおっとりしているが、実は楽しいことが大好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なにか企んでいるときは、必ずと言っていいほど主人公に協力させようとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は、好きな相手ほど困らせたくなる小悪魔的な一面も？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「修平くん、これはひのまる命令よ？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"32356"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f2338618853d8e1a78f32e0a37f3e6177b225262a188d3edb560b7620d6a5570.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/08e4495cfebb7f69b69a0ef4d3517fe1248ba0a7746c4d5958c3aba538d075c5.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"幡宮かのこ","creatorId":"vndb:s260","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s260","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s260","name":"幡宮 かのこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:110802:32356:5940:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c29880","characterName":"桜橋 町子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"34927","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"110802"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14350"],"vndbCharacterId":"c29880"},"originalCharacterName":"桜橋 町子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1103"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"78"},"cupSize":{"reviewS